    lower         = RESOLVE_STR_REF(~pyromancer~)
	
    help          = RESOLVE_STR_REF(~PYROMANCER: This type of mage does not specialize in a particular school, but rather in a specific type of element. Pyromancers use the power of the Elemental Plane of Fire, commanding powerful flames through sheer force of will, although this training has left them less adept at all other forms of magic.
  
Advantages:
– May cast one additional spell per level.
– +50% bonus to all fire damage dealt.
– Gains an additional +2% Fire Resistance per level gained to a maximum of +30%.
– Gains the following spells as mage spells: 
  1st level: Fiery Missile, Ignite
  2nd level: Flame Blade, Firefruit
  3rd level: Lower Fire Resistance, Venom Flame
  4th level: Wall of Fire, Flaming Gate
  5th level: Flame Strike, Burning Vortex
  6th level: Sol's Searing Orb, Inferno Possession
  7th level: Fire Storm, Purify by Flame
  8th level: Blazing Inferno, Volcano
  9th level: Conflagration, Incandescent Hellfire

Disadvantages:
– -50% penalty to all acid, cold, electrical and magical damage dealt.
– -10% penalty to arcane spell duration.
– Incurs a -2% penalty to Cold Resistance per level gained to a maximum of -30%.~)
	
